# Panes - dolphin (actions/dolphin/dolphin_panes.kbd)
**panes + ent**      -- Pane Max
**panes + h**        -- Pane Toggle
**panes + l**        -- Pane Toggle
**panes + up**       -- Pane Toggle
**panes + j**        -- Pane Toggle
**panes + -**        -- Pane Split
**panes + \**        -- Pane Split
**panes + w**        -- Close Tab
**panes + toggle**   -- Pane Toggle
**panes + s**        -- Toggle Left Sidebar
**panes + lsft + s** -- Toggle Right Sidebar
**panes + g**        -- Focus Address Bar
**panes + m**        -- Focus Main
